        <name>RustyCruise Labs</name>
    </author><guid>https://rustycruiselabs.github.io/games/blast-to-zero/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="/img/blasttozero.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div><h2 id="overview" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#overview" class="header-mark"></a>Overview</h2><p>&ldquo;Blast To Zero&rdquo; was a submission for <a href="https://itch.io/jam/solodevelopment-10-new-year-jam" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SoloDevelopment #10 New Year Jam 2026</a>. The goal of participating in the game jam this time round was to try out new game genre and also to test new game mechanics. Compared to previous attempts, I was more comfortable with the development workflow, but still lacking in making the gameplay feel good.</p>
<p>Out of 103 entries, the game ranked <strong>16th</strong>, earning a <strong>3.6/5</strong> rating for gameplay. It&rsquo;s a good attempt, hopefully I can get a 4/5 when I fully complete the game.</p>]]></description>
